            "value": "null"
          }
        ],
        "expected": "NullPointerException (or IllegalArgumentException) because schemaNode is required",
        "description": "The factory must reject a null JsonNode representing the schema definition. This exercises the argument\u2011validation branch that is not covered by the existing tests."
